{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29129","headline":"送上元王明府赴任 · 许浑","name":"送上元王明府赴任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫言名重懒驱鸡，六代江山碧海西。\n日照蒹葭明楚塞，烟分杨柳见隋堤。\n荒城树暗沈书浦，旧宅花连罨画溪。\n官满定知归未得，九重霄汉有丹梯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29129.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29129","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}